<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Nikkei tumbles below key 20,000 level.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Nikkei tumbles below key 20,000 level.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo stock market's Nikkei average tumbled below the key 20,000 level for the first time in more than three months on Friday, depressed by weakness on Wall Street overnight, brokers said.</p>
</text>
